# CONDENSED KICAD NETLIST
# Flattened from the KiCad S-expression netlist. Design content is intact:
# component refs, values, footprints, library parts and their descriptions,
# every custom field, the full pin inventory of each library part, and every
# net with each node's pin number, pin function and electrical type.
# Removed: file paths, timestamps, datasheet URLs, KiCad-internal properties
# and duplicated fields.

