Device:D_Zener_Small | Zener diode, small symbol | pins: 1=K(passive) 2=A(passive)
Device:Q_NPN_BEC | NPN transistor, base/emitter/collector | pins: 1=B(input) 2=E(passive) 3=C(passive)
Device:Q_PMOS_GSD | P-MOSFET transistor, gate/source/drain | pins: 1=G(input) 2=S(passive) 3=D(passive)
Device:R_Small | Resistor, small symbol | pins: 1=(passive) 2=(passive)
Jumper:Jumper_2_Open | Jumper, 2-pole, open | pins: 1=A(passive) 2=B(passive)
Mechanical:MountingHole | Mounting Hole without connection
