fan_controller-rescue:ATtiny45-20P-MCU_Microchip_ATtiny-fan_controller-rescue |  | pins: 1=~{RESET}/PB5(bidirectional) 2=XTAL1/PB3(bidirectional) 3=XTAL2/PB4(bidirectional) 4=GND(power_in) 5=AREF/PB0(bidirectional) 6=PB1(bidirectional) 7=PB2(bidirectional) 8=VCC(power_in)
